\f3\fs26 \cf0 response_format
\f1\fs24  works alongside the tool loop; tools actually run and you still get a structured response\cell \lastrow\row
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 This is the concrete argument for why agents exist as a layer at all.\
Related gotcha from Q&A: 
\f3\fs26 model.with_structured_output(...).bind_tools(...)
\f1\fs24  fails, because 
\f3\fs26 with_structured_output
\f1\fs24  returns a 
\f3\fs26 RunnableSequence
\f1\fs24  and that has no 
\f3\fs26 bind_tools
\f1\fs24 . Bind tools first.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
