\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Read the documentation.
\f1\b0  Stated as the single most valuable skill from the course. He debugged the union question live by reading the schema type signature rather than guessing, and noted that AI assistants are unreliable here.\
\ls4\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 AI output is fuzzy.
\f1\b0  Models hallucinate, cheaper models fail more, and prompt injection is real. Everything in this session exists to make the output deterministic despite that.\
\ls4\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Tool strategy isn't the default because easy sells.
\f1\b0  Frameworks lead with the simple path; the depth is optional and most people skip it.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
